// =====================================================================
//  The Leveling Road — talent trees (Classic 1.12 layout)
// =====================================================================
//  Each talent: [name, icon, tier (0–6), column (0–3), max rank, prerequisite name | 0, description, effects]
//
//  Descriptions: "{5}" means 5 × rank, "{1,2,3}" lists the value for each rank.
//  Effects (per rank) are read by calc() and the combat engine:
//    dmg, melee, spell, white, school{}, crit, meleeCrit, spellCrit, critSchool{}, critMult,
//    spellCritMult, critMultSchool{}, haste, hp, mana, armor, dodge, regen, manaRegen, heal,
//    dmgTaken, stat{}, resGen, costRed, petDmg, dotDmg, wand, travel, startRes, rageRegen,
//    maxRes, vs{creatureType}, weapon{family|'1h'|'2h': {...}}, ab{abilityId: {dmg, cost, cd, cast, crit, dur, gain, stun, cp}},
//    flurry, clearcast, nightfall, ignite, critDot, sealFate, cpOnFinish, relentless, extraAttack,
//    poison, poisonDmg, thorns, stunChance, leech, spiritTap, spiritPower, intArmor, shatter, reviveFaster
//    grants: 'abilityId' (adds a class ability), flavor: 1 (little effect while adventuring)
// =====================================================================

